flowchart TD
  open[Click the toolbar icon] --> select[Select section]
  select --> hover[Hover a section]
  hover --> click[Click to capture]
  click --> adjust[Parent, Smaller, or Lock]
  adjust --> stack[Choose a stack]
  stack --> keys{LLM key saved?}
  keys -->|No| settings[Open Settings]
  settings --> stack
  keys -->|Yes| generate[Generate prompt]
  generate --> jev{Jev key saved?}
  jev -->|Yes| analyze[One Jev request]
  jev -->|No| write[One LLM request]
  analyze --> write
  write --> result[Prompt and reference PNG]
  result --> handoff[Copy prompt and save the PNG]
